   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><div style=\"direction:rtl\"><div style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Arial,Tahoma,sans-serif;font-size:16px\">שלום כולם,</div><div style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Arial,Tahoma,sans-serif;font-size:16px\"><br></div><div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Arial,Tahoma,sans-serif;font-size:16px\">אני שמח מאד להזמין אתכם למפגש R אשר יתקיים בגוגל קמפוס  (Yigal Alon 98, Floor 34, Tel Aviv-Yafo, 67726) ביום רביעי ה- 19 ליולי.<br></div><div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Arial,Tahoma,sans-serif;font-size:16px\">המפגש יתקיים בחסות ה<a href=\"http://www.statistics.org.il/\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" style=\"background:transparent;border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;color:rgb(116,51,153)\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.statistics.org.il/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792496560201000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3UDU218_Ixa-BBQfKELANo\">איגוד הישראלי לסטטיסטיקה</a>, ו<a href=\"https://www.campustelaviv.com/events/\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" style=\"background:transparent;border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;color:rgb(116,51,153)\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.campustelaviv.com/events/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792496560202000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2FxAF3iKsKIlNgtAPhKAj_\">גוגל-קמפוס</a> (&quot;קמפוס תל אביב&quot;).</div><div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Arial,Tahoma,sans-serif;font-size:16px\">אני (טל גלילי) מתנצל על הזמן הרב שעבר מאז <a href=\"http://r-israel.com/2016/01/179\" style=\"background:transparent;border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;color:rgb(116,51,153)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://r-israel.com/2016/01/179&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792496560202000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1bESRdV0TvgFzgrRmu9Irx\">מפגש ה-R הקודם</a> (יותר משנה וחצי עברה, מי היה מאמין). אני מקווה (ומתכנן) שהמפגש הבא יהיה קרוב בהרבה מאשר המפגש הקודם.</div><div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Arial,Tahoma,sans-serif;font-size:16px\"><br></div><div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Arial,Tahoma,sans-serif;font-size:16px\"><br></div><div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Arial,Tahoma,sans-serif;font-size:16px\"><div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"background:transparent;border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline\">ההרצאות במפגש יתחילו בשעה 18:30 ויסתיימו ב- 21:00 (עם הפסקה של חצי שעה באמצע). בשעה הראשונה של המפגש יועברו 3 הרצאות קצרות של כ- 20 דקות כל אחת (סילבוסים מורחבים בהמשך הפוסט):</div><ul style=\"background:transparent;border:0px;margin:0px 1.5em 24px 0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;list-style:square\"><li dir=\"rtl\" style=\"background:transparent;border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline\"><span style=\"background:transparent;border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline\">ההרצאה MultiNav – Multivariate Exploratory Data Analysis תועבר על ידי א</span><span style=\"background:transparent;border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline\">פרת וילנסקי</span></li><li dir=\"rtl\" style=\"background:transparent;border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline\">ההרצאה Predicting the probability of a Severe bodily injury in a Car accident in Tel Aviv תועבר על ידי יונתן שוורץ</li><li dir=\"rtl\" style=\"background:transparent;border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline\">ההרצאה Integrating R based engines in other systems תועבר על ידי עדי שריד</li><li style=\"background:transparent;border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline\">בחלק השני של המפגש תועבר הרצאה של כשעה בשם &quot;מטה אנליזה בקלי קלות&quot; אשר תועבר על ידי פרופ&#39; אברהם-נתן (אבי) קלוגר.</li></ul><div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"background:transparent;border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline\"></div></div><div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Arial,Tahoma,sans-serif;font-size:16px\"></div><div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Arial,Tahoma,sans-serif;font-size:16px\">ההשתתפות היא בחינם, אך <strong style=\"background:transparent;border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline\">דורשת הרשמה מוקדמת</strong> בשני קישורים (סורי על הריבוי, אך אין ברירה):</div><div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Arial,Tahoma,sans-serif;font-size:16px\">1) עליכם ליצור <a href=\"https://www.campus.co/tel-aviv/en/sign-up\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\" style=\"background:transparent;border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;color:rgb(116,51,153)\" target=\"_blank\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://www.campus.co/tel-aviv/en/sign-up&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792496560202000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1h15iDr7He8T9ryZkGUGVn\">שם משתמש באתר של גוגל-קמפוס</a> (ההרשמה היא בחינם, ובצד הימני העליון של המסך)</div><div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Arial,Tahoma,sans-serif;font-size:16px\">2) עליכם להירשם בגוגל-טופס שמופיע <strong style=\"background:transparent;border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline\">ב<a href=\"https://goo.gl/forms/4WrbS8waHmX0lv0D2\" style=\"background:transparent;border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;color:rgb(116,51,153)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://goo.gl/forms/4WrbS8waHmX0lv0D2&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792496560202000&amp;usg=AOvVaw31bdZA4DDtrxZHG0FCH9Xa\">קישור הישיר כאן</a>.</strong></div><div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Arial,Tahoma,sans-serif;font-size:16px\"> _</div><div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Arial,Tahoma,sans-serif;font-size:16px\">יש הגבלת מקום של 120 איש, אז אנא <a href=\"https://goo.gl/forms/4WrbS8waHmX0lv0D2\" style=\"background:transparent;border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;color:rgb(116,51,153)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://goo.gl/forms/4WrbS8waHmX0lv0D2&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792496560202000&amp;usg=AOvVaw31bdZA4DDtrxZHG0FCH9Xa\">מהרו להירשם</a>. לאחר שירשמו 120 הראשונים, ישלח אליהם (כשבוע לקראת המפגש) מייל שמודיע שהם &quot;בפנים&quot;. לאחר מכן <strong style=\"background:transparent;border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline\">ההרשמה תישאר פתוחה ל&quot;רשימת המתנה&quot;, </strong>ובשבוע שלפני הסדנא נברר כמה אנשים לא יוכלו להגיע – ונזמין את האנשים מרשימת ההמתנה להגיע. בד&quot;כ כשליש (לפחות) מהאנשים מבטלים ברגע האחרון, אז הרבה מהאנשים של רשימת ההמתנה צפויים לקבל הזמנה להגיע <strong style=\"background:transparent;border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline\">(אז <a href=\"https://goo.gl/forms/4WrbS8waHmX0lv0D2\" style=\"background:transparent;border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;color:rgb(116,51,153)\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://goo.gl/forms/4WrbS8waHmX0lv0D2&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792496560202000&amp;usg=AOvVaw31bdZA4DDtrxZHG0FCH9Xa\">תירשמו <img src=\"https://ci6.googleusercontent.com/proxy/B8cb9azJm4sP1z2k_gv63Nf7Ptan5JWyozteorSEktfQHxmie4fgUY-L3tc0_MtNRFNjeJ1_0PQaUZwlyO0o8KFxGogQQ7xiS-EHbdTK9tIuJPlgRC7grLNCUMegbu8aROs_Cjip-T6f=s0-d-e1-ft#http://i0.wp.com/r-israel.com/wp-includes/images/smilies/icon_smile.gif?zoom=1.5&amp;w=640\" alt=\":)\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" style=\"background:none;border:none;margin:0px 0.07em;padding:0px;vertical-align:-0.1em;display:inline;min-height:1em;width:1em\"></a> )</strong>.</div><div dir=\"rtl\" style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Arial,Tahoma,sans-serif;font-size:16px\"><br></div><div style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Arial,Tahoma,sans-serif;font-size:16px\">לקריאת תקציר מורחב של ההרצאות <a href=\"http://r-israel.com/2017/06/209#more-209\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://r-israel.com/2017/06/209%23more-209&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792496560202000&amp;usg=AOvVaw11EpMAJpTcn1iaz9Sq0mk8\"><b>לחצו כאן</b></a>.</div><div style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Arial,Tahoma,sans-serif;font-size:16px\"><br></div><div style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Arial,Tahoma,sans-serif;font-size:16px\"><br></div><div style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Arial,Tahoma,sans-serif;font-size:16px\">להתראות שם,</div><div style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Arial,Tahoma,sans-serif;font-size:16px\">טל</div><div style=\"background-image:initial;background-position:initial;background-size:initial;background-repeat:initial;background-origin:initial;background-clip:initial;border:0px;margin:0px;padding:0px;vertical-align:baseline;color:rgb(51,51,51);font-family:Arial,Tahoma,sans-serif;font-size:16px\"><br></div></div><div><div class=\"gmail_signature\"><div dir=\"ltr\"><br>----------------Contact Details:-------------------------------------------------------<br>Contact me: <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">Tal.G...@gmail.com</a> |  <br>Read me: <a href=\"http://www.talgalili.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.talgalili.com&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792496560202000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0XAuP3I00fhOiHyZeXNV9h\">www.talgalili.com</a> (Hebrew) | <a href=\"http://www.biostatistics.co.il\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://www.biostatistics.co.il&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792496560202000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3sFsyOfkTUcerD7bBAIDip\">www.biostatistics.co.il</a> (Hebrew) | <a href=\"http://www.r-statistics.com\" targ